However, Azure API returned InvalidParameter error for imageReference.publisher, indicating the module is not correctly implementing the source_image_reference conversion to the Azure API body format.

This is a known module implementation bug, as the same error appears in the related test case "otherRebootSetting".

Conclusion:
This error cannot be fixed at the test case level by modifying azapi.tf, as the issue lies within the module's implementation of source_image_reference handling. The module is not properly constructing the imageReference object in the request body sent to Azure API.

Note: Steps 1-4 (including state migration with moved blocks) completed successfully, indicating the module correctly handles state migration but fails on fresh deployments with source_image_reference.
